msgid "Issuing a challenge costs one of the two starting challenge tokens."
msgstr "發出挑戰會消耗兩個起始挑戰令牌之一。"

msgid "It doesn't make sense to defend this early in MCR, so early flowers are always declared for a replacement tile. Do so now."
msgstr "在 MCR 中這麼早防守沒有意義，所以早期的花牌總是宣告以獲得替換牌。現在就這樣做。"

