msgid "Riichi Advanced attempts to be mobile-friendly and tries to support all major browsers. This isn't easy, so if you find something amiss, join the Discord!"
msgstr "立直高級版力求對移動設備友好，並嘗試支持所有主流瀏覽器。這並不容易，所以如果你發現什麼不對勁，請加入 Discord！"

msgid "Riichi Advanced is open-source, and is currently hosted on GitHub.Clear"
msgstr "立直高級版是開源的，目前託管在 GitHub 上。"

