msgid "To win, one must exactly match one of the hands on the preselected rules card. The 'nearest hands' button at the bottom can show all nearest hands, which is the easiest way to achieve a win as a beginner. You can also scroll down to see the ruleset's win definitions. The encoding for these definitions is described in the \\\"American hand match specifications\\\" section of 'documentation/documentation.json' on the Riichi Advanced GitHub page."
msgstr "要獲勝，必須精確匹配預選規則牌卡上的手牌之一。底部的「最近手牌」按鈕可以顯示所有最近的手牌，這是初學者實現和牌的最簡單方式。你也可以向下滾動以查看規則集的和牌定義。這些定義的編碼在立直高級版 GitHub 頁面的「documentation/documentation.json」中的「美國手牌匹配規範」部分有描述。"

