msgid "Upon an exhaustive draw (the wall runs out of tiles), players reveal their hands and each player pays each player some amount of points for each Fei Joker in the recipient's hand."
msgstr "在流局時（牌牆耗盡），玩家揭示他們的手牌，每位玩家根據對方手牌中的每張飛牌向其支付一定點數。"

msgid "Upon winning, every player pays an amount equal to the winning hand's fan value."
